{"title": "Tour de France Stages See Wins for Waerenskjold, Schmid, and Pogacar", "summary": "The Tour de France has featured several recent stage victories. Norwegian rider Soren Waerenskjold won the fastest stage in the event's history. Other stage wins were secured by Schmid and Tadej Pogacar, who also maintained his overall lead in the race.", "summary_points": ["Soren Waerenskjold of Norway won a Tour de France stage, setting a new speed record.", "Another stage was won by Schmid.", "Tadej Pogacar won a stage and extended his overall lead.", "Pogacar continues to wear the yellow jersey, indicating his overall lead.", "Rider Merlier was also noted as contending for wins."], "title_hi": "टूर डी फ्रांस के चरणों में वेरेंस्कजॉल्ड, श्मिड और पोगकार की जीत", "summary_hi": "टूर डी फ्रांस में हाल के चरणों में कई जीतें देखी गई हैं। नॉर्वे के राइडर सोरेन वेरेंस्कजॉल्ड ने प्रतियोगिता के इतिहास का सबसे तेज चरण जीता। श्मिड और टाडेज पोगकार ने भी चरण जीते, जिन्होंने दौड़ में अपनी समग्र बढ़त बनाए रखी।", "summary_points_hi": ["नॉर्वे के सोरेन वेरेंस्कजॉल्ड ने टूर डी फ्रांस का एक चरण जीता, जिसने गति का नया रिकॉर्ड बनाया।", "श्मिड ने एक अन्य चरण जीता।", "टाडेज पोगकार ने एक चरण जीता और अपनी समग्र बढ़त बढ़ाई।", "पोगकार समग्र बढ़त का संकेत देते हुए पीली जर्सी पहने हुए हैं।", "राइडर मर्लियर को भी जीत के लिए प्रतिस्पर्धा करते हुए नोट किया गया था।"], "framing": {}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Sports", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://s.france24.com/media/display/c53eb466-82c0-11f1-81a0-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/c6ca17b54c5dc358f612844c6f601d29acf1a2ce.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Norway’s Waerenskjold wins fastest Tour de France stage in history"}, {"source": "France 24", "owner": "France 24", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPYVl4VUZ3MkhtNWdhQmFpaHRFcWVqUXF0eD